  "description": "The Rapide Carbon is designed to not only create speed, but to carry it.\n\nThe Rapide Carbon transfers the power directly to where you need it, providing rapid response and sharp handling to make sure you complete the hottest lap. This bike has already raced in some of the biggest XC races, as well as prove itself on the demanding marathon epics. The Rapide Carbon is your perfect podium hunter.\n\nFor the biggest day, you’re going to need some serious spec. The Rapide CRX is poised to go with Fox Float 32 SC forks, Sram X01 12 speed Eagle drivetrain, and WTB KOM Light wheels. Add to this the fast and sleek Schwalbe Racing Ray/Racing Ralph tyres, Sram Level TL brakes, and Ritchey WCS finishing kit, and you have the perfect winning tool for the day ahead. Enjoy!\n\nRapide Carbon frame, boost spacing\n\nFox Float SC FIT4 29” Remote fork\n\nSram X01 Eagle 12 speed drivetrain\n\nSram Level TL brakes\n\nRitchey WCS finishing kit\n\nRacing Ralph / Racing Ray tubeless ready tyres",
